    ($SATQ$84e5e36c$SATQ$, $SATQ$5014724c-eaa2-486b-8c20-ebe36ecc982b$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$0cfaf377-d228-4468-a554-dba35a20c12b$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.B.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables $SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 3, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: center;"><math alttext="y equals 76"><mrow>
