	<mi>y</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>76</mn>
</mrow>
</math>. Substituting <math alttext="76"><mn>76</mn>
</math> in place of <math alttext="y"><mi>y</mi>
</math> in the second equation yields <math alttext="x squared minus 5 equals 76"><mrow>
	<mrow>
