$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p class="stem_paragraph ">If <span class="italic">a</span> is a solution of the equation above and <span class="math_expression "><span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/87a3de81/img_001_d046c7de.png" alt="a is greater than 0"></span></span>, what is the value of <span class="italic">a</span> ?</p>
$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$["3"]$SATQ$::jsonb, NULL, $SATQ$<p>The correct answer is 3. The solution to the given equation can be found by factoring the quadratic expression. The factors can be determined by finding two numbers with a sum of 1 and a product of <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/87a3de81/img_002_67a0513d.png" alt="negative 12"></span>. The two numbers that meet these constraints are 4 and <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/87a3de81/img_003_0c483384.png" alt="negative 3"></span>. Therefore, the given equation can be rewritten as <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/87a3de81/img_004_f361fe06.png" alt="open parenthesis, x plus 4, close parenthesis, times, open parenthesis, x minus 3, close parenthesis, equals 0"></span>. It follows that the solutions to the equation are <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/87a3de81/img_005_e9fe8b6b.png" alt="x equals negative 4"></span> or <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/87a3de81/img_006_6ec6a793.png" alt="x equals 3"></span>. Since it is given that <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/87a3de81/img_007_fcf80d37.png" alt="a, is greater than 0"></span>, <span class="italic">a</span> must equal 3.</p>
