n   </g>\n  </g>\n </g>\n <defs>\n  <clipPath id=\"p424c901d6f\">\n   <rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"268.898496\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a curve\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>Moving from left to right:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>The curve passes from quadrant 2 to quadrant 1.</li>\n<li>In quadrant 2, the curve trends up sharply to the point (0 comma 3).</li>\n<li>In quadrant 1, the curve trends up sharply.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>The curve passes through the following points:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>approximately (negative 1 comma 0.2)</li>\n<li>(0 comma 3)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of the exponential function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is shown, where <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>. The <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>?</p>","keys":["3"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math>. For the graph of the exponential function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> shown, where <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, it's given that the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. The graph intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore,&nbsp;the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math>.</p>","externalid":"56af9a6d-1c30-4ea5-a528-45b60f366d79","answerOptions":[],"correct_answer":["3"]},"createDate":1743430554982,"updateDate":1743430554982}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554982, 1743430554982),
