 open parenthesis, x minus 3, close parenthesis, and denominator x minus 3, end fraction, plus the fraction with numerator x minus 3, and denominator x minus 3, end fraction, minus the fraction with numerator 2, and denominator x minus 3, end fraction\"></span>. Since the given expression is defined for <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/89fc23af/img_009_2ae3b953.png\" alt=\"x is not equal to 3\"></span>, the expression can be rewritten as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/89fc23af/img_010_cc413dc9.png\" alt=\"x plus 1, minus, the fraction with numerator 2, and denominator x minus 3, end fraction\"></span>.<p>Long division can also be used as an alternate approach. Choices A, B, and C are incorrect and may result from errors made when dividing the two polynomials or making use of structure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":11,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959629,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"89fc23af","skill_cd":"P.A.","score_band_range_cd":7,"skill_desc":"Equivalent expressions","createDate":1691007959629,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"05695-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"bd215896-5637-4396-99f4-e92dcb4dee3a","difficulty":"H"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"05695-DC","section":"Math","prompt":"<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">Which of the following expressions is equivalent to <span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"the fraction with numerator x squared, minus 2 x, minus 5, and denominator x minus 3\"></span>&nbsp;</span>?</p>\n","answer":{"style":"Multiple Choice","choices":{"a":{"body":"