://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 left parenthesis x squared right parenthesis plus 4 left parenthesis 6 right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, which is equivalent to <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 x squared plus 24"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 left parenthesis x squared plus five halves right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 left parenthesis x squared plus 6 right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 left parenthesis x squared plus three halves right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 left parenthesis x squared plus 6 right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 left parenthesis x squared minus one half right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 left parenthesis x squared plus 6 right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"8f82ad81","external_id":"1620a4b4-e1d2-49e7-aae0-096ea9b959f1","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"87593133-11c6-4cd7-8738-319e784053ef","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.A.","skill_desc":"Equivalent expressions","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":2,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"4 left parenthesis x squared plus 6 right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo></math>?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"8c5c039b-9130-4199-b834-e36f585fc62e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4 x squared plus 24\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"9492db9f-2a2b-4755-a1f3-d68212f7ae2e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4 x squared plus 10\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>10</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"a5bd0041-925a-4964-bed4-8a2da3c70cb4","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4 x squared plus 6\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\