e" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/91e7ea5e/img_010_6243bf51.png" alt="h of t equals 0"></span>. If <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/91e7ea5e/img_011_6243bf51.png" alt="h of t equals 0"></span>, then <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/91e7ea5e/img_012_ecd66b50.png" alt="0 equals, 2 times, open parenthesis, t minus 4, close parenthesis, squared, minus 32"></span>. Adding 32 to both sides of this equation yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/91e7ea5e/img_013_e941628e.png" alt="32 equals, 2 times, open parenthesis, t minus 4, close parenthesis, squared"></span>. Dividing both sides of this equation by 2 yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/91e7ea5e/img_014_fc4adeb5.png" alt="16 equals, open parenthesis, t minus 4, close parenthesis, squared"></span>. Taking the square root of both sides of this equation yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/91e7ea5e/img_015_822547ad.png" alt="4 equals, t minus 4"></span>. Adding 4 to both sides of this equation yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/91e7ea5e/img_016_8396726a.png" alt="8 equals t"></span>. Therefore, the value of <span class="italic">t</span> is 8.<p>Choices A, B, and C are incorrect and may result from calculation errors.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
